    {
      "source": "You can register static mappings between keys (i.e. the expected value of\nthe query parameter) and MediaType's via <a href=\"MappingMediaTypeFileExtensionResolver.html#addMapping(java.lang.String,org.springframework.http.MediaType)\"><code>MappingMediaTypeFileExtensionResolver.addMapping(String, MediaType)</code></a>.\nAs of 5.0 this strategy also supports dynamic lookups of keys via\n<a href=\"../../http/MediaTypeFactory.html#getMediaType(org.springframework.core.io.Resource)\"><code>MediaTypeFactory.getMediaType(Resource)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "您可以通过 <a href=\"MappingMediaTypeFileExtensionResolver.html#addMapping(java.lang.String,org.springframework.http.MediaType)\"><code>MappingMediaTypeFileExtensionResolver.addMapping(String, MediaType)</code></a> 注册键（即查询参数的预期值）与 MediaType 之间的静态映射。从 5.0 版本开始，该策略还支持通过 <a href=\"../../http/MediaTypeFactory.html#getMediaType(org.springframework.core.io.Resource)\"><code>MediaTypeFactory.getMediaType(Resource)</code></a> 动态查找键。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "By default this is set to <code>\"format\"</code>.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，该值设置为<code>\"format\"</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
